# Documentation and Knowledge Rules

- Keep `README.md`, `AGENTS.md`, `ARCHITECTURE.md`, `CLAUDE.md`, and `GEMINI.md` at repository root.
- Keep all other docs under `docs/`.
- Use `.agents/skills/docs-knowledge-maintainer/` and `docs/reference/ai-agent-skills.md` when documentation or AI-instruction surfaces change.
- Update `docs/index.md` for new docs and keep the AI adapter files aligned with `docs/reference/ai-agent-integrations.md`.
- Run `python3 tools/lint_docs_structure.py` after documentation or instruction changes.
